  },
  {
   "id": "orderbook",
   "chapter": "Order book: bid, ask & spread",
   "audio": "vo/s4.mp3",
   "audioFrom": 8,
   "from": 1736,
   "frames": 912,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Now, your order.",
     "start": 8,
     "end": 65
    },
    {
     "text": "Every stock has an order book.",
     "start": 65,
     "end": 108
    },
    {
     "text": "On one side, buyers,",
     "start": 108,
     "end": 162
    },
    {
     "text": "and the highest price they'll pay: the bid.",
     "start": 162,
     "end": 244
    },
    {
     "text": "On the other, sellers,",
     "start": 244,
     "end": 295
    },
    {
     "text": "and the lowest price they'll accept: the ask.",
     "start": 295,
     "end": 378
    },
    {
     "text": "Say the best bid is $99,",
     "start": 378,
     "end": 490
    },
    {
     "text": "and the best ask is $100.",
     "start": 490,
     "end": 558
    },
    {
     "text": "That $1 gap is called the spread.",
     "start": 558,
     "end": 618
    },
    {
     "text": "A market order buys right away, at the best ask.",
     "start": 618,
     "end": 714
    },
    {
     "text": "A limit order at $99 joins the queue,",
     "start": 714,
     "end": 803
    },
    {
     "text": "and waits for a seller to come down to it.",
     "start": 803,
     "end": 895
    }
   ],
   "snapped": 11,
   "needed": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "matching",
   "chapter": "Matching engine & price",
   "audio": "vo/s5.mp3",
   "audioFrom": 8,
   "from": 2648,
   "frames": 705,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "The exchange's matching engine",
     "start": 8,
     "end": 66
    },
    {
     "text": "pairs buyers and sellers in microseconds:",
     "start": 66,
     "end": 141
    },
    {
     "text": "best price first,",
     "start": 141,
     "end": 178
    },
    {
     "text": "then first come, first served.",
     "start": 178,
     "end": 245
    },
    {
     "text": "And here's the key.",
     "start": 245,
     "end": 282
    },
    {
     "text": "The price you see is simply the last trade.",
     "start": 282,
     "end": 373
    },
    {
     "text": "When buyers outnumber sellers,",
     "start": 373,
     "end": 423
    },
    {
     "text": "they keep paying the ask, and the price climbs.",
     "start": 423,
     "end": 508
    },
    {
     "text": "When sellers rush out,",
     "start": 508,
     "end": 548
    },
    {
     "text": "they hit the bids, and it falls.",
     "start": 548,
     "end": 613
    },
    {
     "text": "That's supply and demand, tick by tick.",
     "start": 613,
     "end": 681
    }
   ],
